.env*.local

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# Native projects
# NOTE: This repo tracks `android/` because we need to commit native fixes (e.g. DevLauncher crashes).
# Keep build artifacts ignored via `android/.gitignore`.
#
# If you switch back to fully managed Expo and want generated native folders ignored, uncomment:
# /ios
# /android
